# Availability Ledger reads NO environment variables and does NOT load .env files.
# This file exists only to say so. Copying it to .env changes nothing.
#
# Current configuration (checked in source on 2026-10-20):
#   Port        first argument to server.py, e.g. `python3 server.py 8780` (default 8765).
#               The host is always 127.0.0.1.
#   Ollama URL  fixed in ledger/model.py as OLLAMA = "http://127.0.0.1:11434".
#   Model       chosen in the page; default DEFAULT_MODEL = "gemma4:e2b-it-qat" in ledger/model.py.
#   Week, timezone label, reader, day-first WhatsApp dates: chosen in the page.
#
# No API keys or credentials are needed for the current local application.
# Agreed optional roles and implementation gates: docs/INTEGRATIONS.md.
# Competition eligibility/status: docs/COMPETITION.md.
#
# No Sentry, Render, Backboard, Entire, Copilot, ElevenLabs or domain variable
# is read by this app. Development tools may have their own configuration;
# their presence does not create runtime app configuration here.
# ElevenLabs is planned for demo narration, not in-app voice/transcription.
# The hosted fictional saved-output replay and Sentry diagnostics are not built.
#
# Before adding an optional integration, document the actual configuration,
# dependency/network/privacy decision and verified free allowance. It must be
# opt-in, fail safely, and never be required for the local workflow. Keep real
# pilot data out of hosting, telemetry and external development artifacts.
# Do not add speculative key names or real credentials to this example.
# Additional spend is INR 0: no paid fallback, top-up, overage or renewal.
